---
// The Vilij — site header. Identical on all thirteen pages.
// The surrounding <section> is not here: its background gradient is page
// specific, so each page keeps its own header section wrapper.
//
// Logo, then two pills: log in for existing members (teal) and join (orange).
// The site is now a single homepage, so there are no text links — Home,
// Explore The Vilij and About Us were removed at the client's request (Sep
// 2026) — and with nothing left to fold away there is no burger menu either:
// both pills stay in the bar at every width. The logo still goes home, which
// is the way back from the legal pages.
//
// Both pills point at the app. Deliberately no target="_blank":
// app.thevilij.co.uk is the same brand, not an outbound link, so it opens in
// the same tab.
//
// The teal pill keeps the `vnav-cta` class so every page's existing hover rule
// still applies to it; the orange one is `vnav-join`, which that rule does not
// touch. The `vnav-long` words are dropped on the smallest phones so both pills
// fit beside the logo; sizing lives in src/styles/responsive.css.
---
<div class="vnav-shell">
  <nav style="display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;">
    <a href="/" class="vnav-logo"><img src="/assets/logo.png" alt="The Vilij" width="570" height="248" decoding="async" style="height:62px;width:auto;display:block;" /></a>
    <div class="vnav-right" style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:24px;">
      <a href="https://app.thevilij.co.uk" class="vnav-cta vpill" style="font-family:Lato;font-weight:700;font-size:16px;color:#ffffff;background:#1f9ca0;padding:12px 24px;border-radius:30px;text-decoration:none;white-space:nowrap;box-shadow:0 6px 16px rgba(31,156,160,0.3);"><span class="vnav-long">Vilijer </span>Log In</a>
      <a href="https://app.thevilij.co.uk/sign-up" class="vnav-join vpill" style="font-family:Lato;font-weight:700;font-size:16px;color:#ffffff;background:#f28121;padding:12px 24px;border-radius:30px;text-decoration:none;white-space:nowrap;box-shadow:0 6px 16px rgba(242,129,33,0.3);">Join <span class="vnav-long">for </span>£10/month</a>
    </div>
  </nav>
</div>
